{"4527460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Odyssey", "steam_appid": 4527460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy is vast. Learn to move through it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Odyssey is a turn-based tactical RPG set across a sprawling, hand-crafted galaxy where mastering the art of orbital movement is just as critical as mastering combat. Plan trajectories, exploit gravitational forces, and navigate living star systems where every decision about how you move through space carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Galaxy Worth Exploring</strong> No two corners of the universe are alike. From neon-lit space stations buzzing with merchants and mercenaries to forgotten worlds steeped in arcane power, Void Odyssey rewards those who venture off the beaten flight path. Chart your course and carve your own story through the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cosmos is Yours to Navigate</strong> In Void Odyssey, space isn't just the backdrop, it's a mechanic. Every system flows with real orbital motion, and learning to move through it shapes every step of your journey. From threading debris fields to timing a planetary slingshot, the voyage between destinations is an experience in itself and not just a means to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Magic Meets the Stars</strong> Void Odyssey doesn't ask you to choose between fantasy and science fiction. Ancient magic and starship engineering exist side by side, woven into a genre-bending universe that plays by its own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cast as Big as the Universe</strong> The galaxy is alive with colorful, memorable characters with their own agendas, backstories, and something to offer anyone willing to listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Void Odyssey is currently in development. Wishlist now to follow our journey and be among the first to explore the galaxy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Original music composed and produced by Adam Linnell.</i> </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy is vast. Learn to move through it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Odyssey is a turn-based tactical RPG set across a sprawling, hand-crafted galaxy where mastering the art of orbital movement is just as critical as mastering combat. Plan trajectories, exploit gravitational forces, and navigate living star systems where every decision about how you move through space carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Galaxy Worth Exploring</strong> No two corners of the universe are alike. From neon-lit space stations buzzing with merchants and mercenaries to forgotten worlds steeped in arcane power, Void Odyssey rewards those who venture off the beaten flight path. Chart your course and carve your own story through the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cosmos is Yours to Navigate</strong> In Void Odyssey, space isn't just the backdrop, it's a mechanic. Every system flows with real orbital motion, and learning to move through it shapes every step of your journey. From threading debris fields to timing a planetary slingshot, the voyage between destinations is an experience in itself and not just a means to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Magic Meets the Stars</strong> Void Odyssey doesn't ask you to choose between fantasy and science fiction. Ancient magic and starship engineering exist side by side, woven into a genre-bending universe that plays by its own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cast as Big as the Universe</strong> The galaxy is alive with colorful, memorable characters with their own agendas, backstories, and something to offer anyone willing to listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p